OL,3,AWill Harry's return heal rift with his
OL,4,Abrother? Don't hold your breath
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the past six years Prince William
OL,7,Fand Prince Harry have practically and
OL,8,Femotionally been oceans apart.
OL,10,FBut with the Sussex family moving back
OL,11,Fto the UK, will the closing of the
OL,12,Fphysical distance help ease the anguish
OL,13,Fand fix the angst between William and
OL,14,FHarry?
OL,16,FDon't hold your breath.
OL,18,FThis isn't a regular sibling fallout.
OL,19,FIt is a deep-rooted fracture filled
OL,20,Fwith anger, resentment and a total loss
OL,21,Fof trust.
